language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Schedule 4 people into 4 interview slots based on their free-busy schedules.
given m : matrix indexed by [int(1..4), int(1..4)] of int(0..1)
find x : matrix indexed by [int(1..4), int(1..4)] of bool

branching on [x]

such that
$ each person is assigned to exactly one interview slot
forAll i : int(1..4) . (sum j : int(1..4) . x[i,j]) = 1,
$ each interview slot is assigned to exactly one person
forAll j : int(1..4) . (sum i : int(1..4) . x[i,j]) = 1,
$ a person can only be assigned to a slot in which they are free
forAll i : int(1..4) . forAll j : int(1..4) . (x[i,j] -> m[i,j] = 1)
